    "body": "Is it handy? Obviously yes. Is it good? Probably not.\r\nIf `Response.json` is added, sooner or later we will have to add `Response.arrayBuffer`, `Response.blob`, `Response.text / Response.string` (And maybe some people / companies even want `Response.formData`).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
