    "updated_at": "2022-12-13T07:08:18Z",
    "body": "That is being tracked by https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/21550. I think this has shipped so I don't think we're in a position to rename.\r\n\r\nI think the name is reasonable and consistent with other names on the object. That it pushes the ecosystem to no longer conflate statics and non-statics is a bonus.",
